  "Id": 1448,
  "Title": "Policy dialogue on Health in Education",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "A one-day policy dialogue was organised by AKU-IED on April 09, 2009 on 'Health Promotion through Schools in Pakistan.'",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>A one-day policy dialogue was organised by AKU-IED on April 09, 2009 on 'Health Promotion through Schools in Pakistan.' The dialogue aimed at advocating content and approaches for health education in schools, based on lessons learnt from the Health Education initiatives of AKU-IED. More than 60 representatives from the provincial ministries of Education, including the Head of the Curriculum Bureau, INGOs (International Non-Governmental Organisations) and NGOs working with children in health and education, including UNICEF, WHO, EB and AKDN, AKU-IED faculty and MEd students participated in the dialogue.</p>",
